    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- SELECTED resonant capacitor:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="6059" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">C.r</e>
        <e type="operand">100</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">nF</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="6102" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">round C.r UP: a larger C.r lowers Q.pk and buys ZVS margin, at the cost of a higher top frequency.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="6133" width="470" height="65" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Resonant inductor for the selected C.r:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="6133" width="1080" height="65" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="2">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">L.r_calc</e>
        <e type="operand">1</e>
        <e type="operand">C.r</e>
        <e type="operand">2</e>
        <e type="operand">π</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operand">f.r_t</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="bracket">(</e>
        <e type="operand">2</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">μH</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">11.26</e>
        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="6206" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- SELECTED resonant inductor:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="6206" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">L.r</e>
        <e type="operand">11</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">μH</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="6249" width="470" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Calculated magnetizing inductance:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="6249" width="1080" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="2">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">L.m_calc</e>
        <e type="operand">L.r</e>
        <e type="operand">λ</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">μH</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">8.87</e>
        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="6439" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- SELECTED magnetizing inductance:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="6439" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">L.m</e>
        <e type="operand">20</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">μH</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="6482" width="1560" height="51" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">[45]  Normally NEVER round L.m up - it lowers lambda.act and eats the ZVS margin. Here L.m is not free: the winding fixes n.T = N.x*N.p/N.s, and the selected n then forces lambda.act = (n.T/n)^2 - 1, so L.m = L.r/lambda.act exactly. The cost lands on k.lam,</p>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">which is a NO-LOAD condition; the loaded corners are judged by k.ZVS and k.ceil instead.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="6557" width="1560" height="27" color="#0f2a44" fontSize="12" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;">7. Final Tank Check   [46] - [54]</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="6592" width="470" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Actual lambda:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="6592" width="1080" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="4">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">λ.act</e>
        <e type="operand">L.r</e>
        <e type="operand">L.m</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">0.5500</e>
        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="6653" width="470" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- lambda against its requirement:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="6653" width="1080" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="3">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">k.lam</e>
        <e type="operand">λ.act</e>
        <e type="operand">λ</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">0.443</e>
        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="6714" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">NOT A PASS/FAIL - a NO-LOAD requirement. The hardware limit is the VCO ceiling, checked by k.ceil.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="6745" width="470" height="44" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Real (wound) turns ratio if Lr is the leakage:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="6745" width="1080" height="44" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="4">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">n.T</e>
        <e type="operand">n</e>
        <e type="operand">1</e>
        <e type="operand">λ.act</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
        <e type="function" args="1">sqrt</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">7.4999</e>
        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="6797" width="470" height="64" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Series characteristic impedance:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="6797" width="1080" height="64" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="3">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">Z.0s</e>
        <e type="operand">L.r</e>
        <e type="operand">C.r</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
        <e type="function" args="1">sqrt</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">10.488</e>
        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="6869" width="470" height="64" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Parallel characteristic impedance:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="6869" width="1080" height="64" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="3">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">Z.0p</e>
        <e type="operand">L.r</e>
        <e type="operand">L.m</e>
