    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="7355" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Open-circuit inductance to specify:</p>
