    <region left="20" top="30853" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">[118] allows only 20 %, which is optimistic. About 1.6x is common practice - use the row below.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
