        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="39370" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">plus whatever leakage spike the winding carries - measure it on the prototype and rate V.CEO and C.aux above both.</p>
